      "summary_en": "Neeko slings a tangle that damages and roots everything it passes through. If the tangle kills an enemy or passes through a champion, it becomes larger, faster, and roots for longer.",
      "summary_zh": "妮蔻投出一团倒刺，对它沿途的所有东西造成伤害和禁锢效果。如果倒刺击杀了一个敌人或穿过了一名英雄，就会变得更大、更快并且禁锢时间更长。",
